---
import SquarespaceFooter from '../components/SquarespaceFooter.astro';
import SquarespaceHeader from '../components/SquarespaceHeader.astro';
import { createShellConfig } from '../config/shell';
import SquarespaceShellLayout from '../layouts/SquarespaceShellLayout.astro';

const config = createShellConfig({
  siteTitle: 'Start Your ACT or SAT Prep | Hasan Tutoring',
  description: 'A simple three-step roadmap for choosing an exam, selecting a test date, and beginning ACT or SAT preparation.',
});
---

<SquarespaceShellLayout config={config}>
  <div id="siteWrapper" class="clearfix site-wrapper start-page">
    <SquarespaceHeader config={config} />

    <main id="page" class="start-main" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="start-hero" aria-labelledby="start-title">
        <div class="start-hero__inner">
          <h1 id="start-title">The college testing process can be daunting, here’s a good guide to help you <span>get started.</span></h1>
          <p class="start-hero__lede">Honestly, it's not that complicated. Use this guide to choose an exam, set a timeline, and build a plan.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <nav class="step-nav" aria-label="Test prep roadmap">
        <div class="step-nav__inner">
          <a href="/start/#pick-an-exam" class="is-active" data-step-link="pick-an-exam"><span>Pick an Exam</span></a>
          <a href="/start/#pick-a-date" data-step-link="pick-a-date"><span>Pick an Exam Date</span></a>
          <a href="/start/#get-started" data-step-link="get-started"><span>Start Test Prep</span></a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <div class="roadmap">
        <section id="pick-an-exam" class="roadmap-step" data-step-section>
          <div class="roadmap-step__number" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
          <div class="roadmap-step__heading">
            <p>Step one</p>
            <h2>Pick an Exam</h2>
            <h3>Which test should I take?</h3>
            <nav class="step-one-links" aria-label="Step one resources">
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/practice-tests">Practice Tests</a>
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/tests">Test Information</a>
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/act">ACT</a>
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/sat">SAT</a>
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/contact">Contact Me</a>
            </nav>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-step__content">
            <div class="step-one-copy">
              <p>Colleges accept both the ACT and SAT, despite old ideas that some regions prefer one or the other. It’s also totally fine to take both, but it’s not a good idea to study for both at the same time.</p>

              <p>if you haven’t decided on whether to take the ACT or SAT, the best thing you can do is take a practice test of each. If you do way better on one than the other, your decision is pretty clear. Go with the one you did better on.</p>

              <p>If you do about the same on both practice tests, go with whichever test you like better, whichever you feel more comfortable with.</p>

              <p>For the ACT, you can download a pdf document of the exam, time yourself, grade it, and see your results. For the SAT, you can log into the Bluebook Exam app offered by College Board (you’ll need to create a username and password), take a digital exam, and automatically see your results. Or, you can <a href="/practice-tests">take a practice test here</a> and get a custom score report. No need for a mandatory “consultation” (sales pitch)..</p>

              <p>If you want more information about the exams, such as format, timing, subject matter etc, please checkout <a href="/tests">tests</a>.</p>

              <p>If you want more in-depth information about each exam, please checkout <a href="/act">ACT</a>, <a href="/sat">SAT</a></p>

              <p>If you want to talk about your personal situation, please feel free to <a href="/contact">reach out</a>. I’ll respond personally and would even be happy to schedule a call!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="pick-a-date" class="roadmap-step roadmap-step--paper" data-step-section>
          <div class="roadmap-step__number" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <div class="roadmap-step__heading">
            <p>Step two</p>
            <h2>Pick an Exam Date</h2>
            <h3>When should I begin?</h3>
            <div class="step-contact">
              <p>Feel free to reach out do discuss your specific situation.</p>
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/contact">Contact Me</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-step__content">
            <div class="step-two-copy step-two-copy--summary">
              <section>
                <h4>When to begin</h4>
                <p>Most students begin between the summer before Junior year and the summer after it. Starting in Sophomore year can make sense for prospective athletes, students expecting an especially demanding Junior year, or families who simply prefer to get an early start. Because college applications are due in the fall of Senior year, it’s best not to wait too far beyond Junior year—but meaningful improvement is still possible on a shorter timeline.</p>
              </section>
              <section>
                <h4>A comfortable plan</h4>
                <p>For most students, choosing a test date two to three months away provides a comfortable preparation window. A typical plan includes one 90-minute session each week, three to four hours of homework between meetings, and three full practice tests: one at the beginning, one halfway through, and one shortly before test day.</p>
              </section>
              <section>
                <h4>Where and how we meet</h4>
                <p>Sessions are available in person on the Plaza in the Kansas City area or online via Zoom anywhere in the world. All materials are provided and use real, previously administered tests.</p>
              </section>
              <section>
                <h4>A plan that fits you</h4>
                <p>There’s no one-size-fits-all schedule. Reach out anytime to discuss your goals, timing, and exact situation.</p>
              </section>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="get-started" class="roadmap-step roadmap-step--dark" data-step-section>
          <div class="roadmap-step__number" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
          <div class="roadmap-step__heading">
            <p>Step three</p>
            <h2>Get Started with Test Prep</h2>
            <h3>What are the next steps</h3>
            <div class="step-contact">
              <p>Feel free to reach out and we'll set something up specific to you</p>
              <a class="start-contact-cta" href="/contact">Contact Me</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-step__content">
            <p class="roadmap-step__lead">Simply reach out. Call/text/email and we'll set something up. This isn't a rigid corporation, and nothing is set in stone. My schedule is very flixible and we'll tailor a program to your schedule and your needs.</p>
            <ol class="prep-cycle">
              <li><span>01</span><div><b>Measure</b><p>Start with a full practice test or a timed section.</p></div></li>
              <li><span>02</span><div><b>Learn</b><p>Recognize the question types and the steps that solve them.</p></div></li>
              <li><span>03</span><div><b>Practice</b><p>Build accuracy first, then add timing and repetition.</p></div></li>
              <li><span>04</span><div><b>Adjust</b><p>Review mistakes and focus the next week where it matters most.</p></div></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <SquarespaceFooter config={config} />
  </div>
</SquarespaceShellLayout>

<script>
  const nav = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.step-nav');
  const header = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#header');
  const links = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('[data-step-link]'));
  const sections = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-step-section]'));

  const sizeNav = () => {
    if (nav && header) nav.style.setProperty('--header-height', `${header.offsetHeight}px`);
  };

  const setActive = (id: string) => {
    links.forEach((link) => {
      const active = link.dataset.stepLink === id;
      link.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      if (active) link.setAttribute('aria-current', 'step');
      else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');
    });
  };

  sizeNav();
  window.addEventListener('resize', sizeNav, { passive: true });

  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    const visible = entries.filter((entry) => entry.isIntersecting).sort((a, b) => b.intersectionRatio - a.intersectionRatio)[0];
    if (visible) setActive(visible.target.id);
  }, { rootMargin: '-25% 0px -55% 0px', threshold: [0, .15, .35] });

  sections.forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));

</script>

<style>
  :global(#page.start-main) { width: 100% !important; max-width: none !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }
  .start-page { overflow-x: clip; background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-text-dark); }
  .start-main { width: 100%; min-width: 0; overflow: visible; }
  .start-page *, .start-page *::before, .start-page *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .start-hero { position: relative; min-height: 500px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) var(--space-section-h); overflow: hidden; background: var(--color-surface); }
  .start-hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .38; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(31,27,23,.06) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(31,27,23,.06) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px; mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000, transparent 82%); }
  .start-hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: min(100%, 920px); text-align: center; }
  .start-kicker, .roadmap-step__heading > p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); font: 700 .72rem/1 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .17em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .start-hero h1 { max-width: 22ch; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--color-text-dark); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.025em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .start-hero h1 span { color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); }
  .start-hero__lede { max-width: 620px; margin: 1.5rem auto 0; color: var(--color-muted); font: 300 1rem/1.65 var(--font-sans); }
  .start-hero__cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: .35rem; color: var(--color-text-dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-text-dark); font: 600 .78rem/1.3 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .04em; text-decoration: none; }
  .start-hero__cta span { color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); font-size: 1rem; }

  .step-nav { --header-height: 90px; position: sticky; top: var(--header-height); z-index: 80; background: rgba(255,255,255,.95); border-block: 1px solid #ddd6cb; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .step-nav__inner { width: min(100%, 1180px); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .step-nav a { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .75rem; min-height: 68px; padding: .8rem 1rem; color: #777068; font: 600 .79rem/1.2 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .025em; text-decoration: none; transition: color 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease; }
  .step-nav a + a { border-left: 1px solid #e5dfd6; }
  .step-nav a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: auto 0 -1px; height: 3px; background: var(--color-accent-crimson); transform: scaleX(0); transition: transform 200ms ease; }
  .step-nav a:hover, .step-nav a.is-active { color: var(--color-text-dark); background: var(--color-surface-warm); }
  .step-nav a.is-active::after { transform: scaleX(1); }

  .roadmap-step { position: relative; min-height: 560px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(250px, .72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr); column-gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem); align-content: center; padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) max(var(--space-section-h), calc((100vw - 1180px) / 2)); scroll-margin-top: 150px; background: var(--color-surface); overflow: hidden; }
  .roadmap-step__number { position: absolute; right: max(var(--space-section-h), calc((100vw - 1180px) / 2)); top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); color: rgba(31,27,23,.055); font: 400 clamp(9rem, 22vw, 20rem)/.8 var(--font-serif); letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .roadmap-step__heading, .roadmap-step__content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .roadmap-step__heading { position: relative; top: auto; align-self: start; }
  .roadmap-step__heading h2 { max-width: 11ch; margin: 0; font: 700 clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem)/1.05 var(--font-serif); letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .roadmap-step__heading h3 { max-width: 18ch; margin: 1rem 0 0; color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); font: 400 clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.55rem)/1.2 var(--font-serif); }
  .step-contact { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .step-contact p { max-width: 28ch; margin: 0; color: var(--color-muted); font: 300 1rem/1.65 var(--font-sans); }
  .start-contact-cta { display: inline-flex; min-height: 46px; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: .85rem 1.4rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; background: var(--color-text-dark); border: 1px solid var(--color-text-dark); border-radius: 999px; font: 600 .8rem/1 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .04em; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; }
  .start-contact-cta:hover { background: var(--color-accent-crimson); border-color: var(--color-accent-crimson); }
  .start-contact-cta:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-accent-gold-light); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .step-one-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .step-one-links .start-contact-cta { margin-top: 0; }
  .roadmap-step__content { max-width: 680px; }
  .roadmap-step__lead { margin: 0 0 2.25rem; color: var(--color-text-dark); font: 400 clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.45rem)/1.48 var(--font-serif); }
  .step-two-copy { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .step-two-copy--summary section { padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .step-two-copy--summary h4 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; color: var(--color-text-dark); font: 400 1.35rem/1.2 var(--font-serif); }
  .step-two-copy--summary p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-muted); font: 300 1rem/1.65 var(--font-sans); }
  .step-one-copy { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .step-one-copy p { margin: 0; padding: 1.15rem 0; color: var(--color-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); font: 300 1rem/1.65 var(--font-sans); }
  .step-one-copy p:first-child { color: var(--color-text-dark); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; }
  .step-one-copy a { color: var(--color-text-dark); font-weight: 600; text-decoration-color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
  .step-one-copy a:hover { color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); }
  .decision-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); border: 1px solid #dcd5cb; }
  .decision-grid article { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); }
  .decision-grid article + article { border-left: 1px solid #dcd5cb; }
  .decision-grid article > span { display: inline-grid; width: 46px; height: 46px; place-items: center; color: #fff; background: #1f1b17; border-radius: 50%; font: 700 .68rem/1 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .decision-grid h4 { margin: 1.25rem 0 .65rem; font: 400 1.35rem/1.15 var(--font-serif); }
  .decision-grid p, .roadmap-aside { margin: 0; color: #6b645c; font: 300 .97rem/1.62 var(--font-sans); }
  .roadmap-note { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; color: var(--color-muted); background: var(--color-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-crimson); font: 300 .95rem/1.55 var(--font-sans); }
  .roadmap-note strong { color: #25211d; font-weight: 600; }
  .roadmap-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 1.25rem 1.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; min-height: 48px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: .9rem 1.35rem; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 999px; font: 600 .76rem/1 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .055em; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease; }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .button--dark { color: #fff; background: #1f1b17; border-color: #1f1b17; }
  .button--crimson { color: #fff; background: var(--color-accent-crimson); border-color: var(--color-accent-crimson); }
  .button--light { color: var(--color-text-light); background: var(--color-text-dark); border-color: var(--color-text-dark); }
  .text-link { color: #29241f; font: 600 .78rem/1.3 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .035em; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; }

  .roadmap-step--paper { background: var(--color-surface); }
  .timeline { border-top: 1px solid #cfc6ba; }
  .timeline div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfc6ba; }
  .timeline b { color: #29241f; font: 600 .76rem/1.4 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .035em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .timeline span { color: #625b53; font: 300 .98rem/1.5 var(--font-sans); }
  .roadmap-aside { margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 60ch; }

  .roadmap-step--dark { color: var(--color-text-dark); background: var(--color-surface); }
  .roadmap-step--dark .roadmap-step__number { color: rgba(31,27,23,.055); }
  .roadmap-step--dark .roadmap-step__heading h3, .roadmap-step--dark .roadmap-step__heading > p { color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); }
  .roadmap-step--dark .roadmap-step__lead { color: var(--color-text-dark); }
  .roadmap-step--dark .text-link { color: var(--color-text-dark); }
  .prep-cycle { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .prep-cycle li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; padding: 1.1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .prep-cycle > li > span { padding-top: .2rem; color: var(--color-highlight-vivid); font: 700 .67rem/1 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .prep-cycle b { display: block; font: 400 1.3rem/1.1 var(--font-serif); }
  .prep-cycle p { margin: .3rem 0 0; color: var(--color-muted); font: 300 .95rem/1.5 var(--font-sans); }

  a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-accent-gold-light); outline-offset: 4px; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .start-hero { min-height: 420px; padding-block: 3.5rem; }
    .start-hero__inner { width: calc(100vw - 3rem); }
    .start-hero__lede { width: 100%; }
    .step-nav { width: 100vw; max-width: 100vw; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; }
    .step-nav__inner { width: max-content; min-width: 100%; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
    .step-nav a { min-height: 58px; padding-inline: 1rem; justify-content: flex-start; }
    .roadmap-step { min-height: 0; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; scroll-margin-top: 125px; }
    .roadmap-step__number { right: .75rem; top: 3rem; font-size: 7rem; }
    .roadmap-step__heading { position: relative; top: auto; }
    .roadmap-step__heading h2 { max-width: 11ch; font-size: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 2.8rem); }
    .decision-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .decision-grid article + article { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid #dcd5cb; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 430px) {
    .timeline div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .35rem; }
    .roadmap-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .button, .start-contact-cta, .step-nav a::after { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
